{"author":"carlo.cifarelli@gmail.com","body":"Documented the ti next --json shape: bare ticket object on match, sentinel {\"next\": null} on no-match. Added a note to README Machine Output and a nextNull definition (+ oneOf branch + description) to docs/schema/v1.json. Kept the on-match bare-ticket shape (consistent with ti show) rather than normalizing, to avoid a breaking change. The null-shape behavior already has a CLI test."}